# src/

CLI and configuration layer for the Udex gRPC server. Provides the entry point, command-line interface types, and configuration structures for the server and datastore. Handles Tokio runtime setup, TLS initialization, command dispatch, and error-to-exit-code mapping.

## Files

- `main.rs` -- Entry point: CLI parsing, runtime setup, TLS provider initialization, command dispatch, error mapping
- `cli.rs` -- Clap command-line interface definitions: Cli struct, Commands and subcommand enums
- `config.rs` -- Server and datastore configuration with TLS, authorization, and secrets_rs integration
